1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,800
8:40 PM. Far ahead, a small blue light
glows on the wall.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:09,767
Rule nine. Follow the blue lights.
Down here, blue means a phone, a power
box, or a way out.

3
00:00:10,467 --> 00:00:12,667
Blue light. Everybody, follow the
blue.

4
00:00:13,367 --> 00:00:16,533
Then you hear water. Rushing,
somewhere off to the left.

5
00:00:17,233 --> 00:00:19,767
There's a side tunnel. It's shorter. I
can feel air.

6
00:00:20,467 --> 00:00:25,033
Rule ten. Never walk toward running
water. The pumps are off. Tunnels
flood.

7
00:00:25,733 --> 00:00:26,867
Air means a way out!

8
00:00:28,133 --> 00:00:31,533
Air also means a shaft. A forty-foot
drop. Stay on the line.
